    <Cell ss:StyleID="s17"><Data ss:Type="String">Description, Objective of the scheme</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="s17"><Data ss:Type="String">To generate capital appreciation and income generation with dynamic allocation to different asset classes like equities, InVITs, commodities and  fixed income layered with derivatives long-short trading strategies.  There is no assurance that the investment objective of the Investment strategy will be achieved.</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
